<div class="r-site" data-r107-page data-family="design-private" data-modules="1,2,3,4,5"><header class="r-intro r-intro--small"><p class="r-eyebrow">SUIJI</p><h1>My local designs</h1><p>The versions saved in this browser. This is not a connected customer account or a server project record.</p></header><section class="r-section"><div data-local-design-list></div><a class="r-button" href="{{ routes.root_url | append: '/pages/studio-workspace' | replace: '//', '/' }}">Open the workspace<span aria-hidden="true"> ↗</span></a></section><section class="r-section "><div class="r-section__heading"><h2>Before a piece can be made</h2></div><ol class="r-progress"><li>Local draft</li><li>Concept review</li><li>Feasibility</li><li>Quote approval</li><li>Prototype / making</li><li>Complete</li></ol><p>No making review has been submitted and no quote is approved. A confirmed quote identifies the exact version, component materials, cost breakdown and timing before work starts.</p></section><section class="r-section "><div class="r-section__heading"><h2>Handmade, with agreed details</h2></div><p>All our jewelry is handmade. Texture and surface details vary and cannot be guaranteed to match a photo exactly. Materials, dimensions, function and important details confirmed before making still follow the description.</p><a class="r-link" href="{{ routes.root_url | append: '/pages/contact' | replace: '//', '/' }}">Ask about a local version<span aria-hidden="true"> ↗</span></a></section></div>
